WEBVTT

00:11:29.310 --> 00:11:32.801
and overwhelmingly,
they want to be part of the solution.

00:11:33.357 --> 00:11:36.347
Here, in Australia, we now have

00:11:36.371 --> 00:11:43.022
10,636,101 superannuation accounts

00:11:43.046 --> 00:11:44.386
that are tobacco-free.

00:11:44.410 --> 00:11:46.138
That one is mine, by the way.

00:11:46.162 --> 00:11:53.077
(Applause)

00:11:53.101 --> 00:11:55.014
There is still a lot of work to be done,

00:11:55.038 --> 00:11:58.656
but I've watched the conversation go
from "Should we go tobacco-free?"

00:11:58.680 --> 00:12:00.600
to "Why haven't we done it yet?"